There are houses where you simply live. And there are houses designed to provide more space, comfort and quality of life at all stages of the family.

This 3 bedroom flat, located on the 1st floor of the Varandas do Pinhal development, is distinguished by its contemporary architecture, generous areas and excellent natural light, offering a modern, functional and welcoming environment.

The large social area is developed in open space, harmoniously uniting the living room and the kitchen in a space designed for socialising and everyday life. With direct access to one of the balconies, this environment naturally extends to the outside, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining or leisure time.

The private area consists of a comfortable suite, two bedrooms of excellent dimensions and two complete sanitary facilities, ensuring the privacy, functionality and versatility that a family seeks.

The two balconies, with a total area of 17.56 m², offer a pleasant connection to the outside, allowing you to enjoy the tranquillity of the green surroundings that characterise the development.

Apartment features

- Living room (25.14 m²) and kitchen (9.06 m²) in open space concept;

- Suite with 15.03 m²;

- Two bedrooms with 13.43 m² and 9.00 m²;

- Entrance hall with 5.42 m²;

- Social toilet (2.56 m²);

- Private bathroom in the suite (4.22 m²);

- Two private balconies (10.36 m² and 7.20 m²), totalling 17.56 m²;

- 2 indoor parking spaces;

- Private storage room with 13.38 m², offering excellent storage capacity.

Comfort and energy efficiency

Designed to respond to the demands of contemporary living, this flat integrates solutions that privilege comfort, energy efficiency and the quality of finishes.

Equipment and finishes:

- Pre-installation of air conditioning;

- Pre-installation of central heating;

- Fully equipped kitchen with Beko appliances;

- Thermosiphon thermal solar panels for the production of domestic hot water (DHW);

- High quality materials and finishes, selected to ensure durability and appreciation of the property.

The venture

Scheduled for completion in July 2027, Varandas do Pinhal is a contemporary residential development located in the heart of Pinhal do General, one of the areas with the highest growth and appreciation on the South Bank.

Inserted next to the future Alameda do Poder Local Garden, which will have the planting of 254 new trees, it offers a quiet environment, surrounded by green spaces, where nature and urban life coexist in perfect harmony.

Consisting of 12 apartments, spread over three floors, it offers T1, T2 and T3 typologies, designed to meet the needs of those looking for their own home or a safe investment.

The development stands out for offering:

- Building with 2 elevators;

- Indoor parking;

- Collections in most fractions;

- Large private terraces on the ground floor fractions;

- Generous balconies on the upper floors;

- Excellent sun exposure;

- Modern finishes and solutions designed for comfort and efficiency.

Prime location

Living at Varandas do Pinhal is to benefit from a location that combines tranquillity, nature and excellent accessibility.

A few minutes from Coina Train Station and about 650 meters from a bus stop, the development has fast connections to the Fertagus stations of Coina and Fogueteiro, to Lisbon (Sete Rios), Sesimbra and to the Cacilhas River Terminal, passing through Corroios.

Nearby you will also find:

- Commerce and services about 3 minutes away;

- Coina Train Station 5 minutes away;

- Quinta do Perú Golf & Country Club 5 minutes away;

- National and international schools;

- Quick access to N10, IC32 and A33;

- About 20 minutes from Lisbon;

- Approximately 20 minutes from the beaches of Costa da Caparica and Arrábida;

- About 30 minutes from Humberto Delgado Airport.

Varandas do Pinhal is the ideal choice for those looking for a new flat with generous areas, two balconies, two parking spaces, a large storage room and high quality finishes, inserted in a modern development and in a 

location in constant appreciation.

Book your visit now and discover your future home.

